      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%@ · %@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%@ 不支持 %@ 硬件解码，会用软件解码（更费电，可能卡顿）": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%1$@ can’t decode %2$@ in hardware and will use software decoding (more power, may stutter)"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%@ 关闭了你的摄像头": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%@ turned off your camera"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%@ 出示的证书与你上次连接时记住的不同。可能的原因：服务器重装或更换了证书；也可能有人正在拦截你的连接。如果不确定，请先联系服务器管理员核对指纹。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%@ presented a certificate different from the one remembered last time. The server may have been reinstalled or its certificate replaced — or someone may be intercepting your connection. If unsure, verify the fingerprint with the server admin."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%@ 已允许你发言": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%@ allowed you to speak"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%@ 无法解码 %@，会看 H.264 画面": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%1$@ can’t decode %2$@ and will see H.264"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%@ 无法解码 %@，看不到画面": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%1$@ can’t decode %2$@ and won’t see the share"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%@ 正在共享屏幕": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%@ is sharing their screen"
