    "服务器内置的归属地库只包含 IPv4。IPv6 库约 37 MB，会从 GitHub 下载到服务器的数据目录，之后一直可用（Docker 部署时数据目录需要持久化，否则重建容器后要重新下载）。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The server's built-in location database only covers IPv4. The IPv6 database (about 37 MB) is downloaded from GitHub into the server's data directory and kept there. With Docker, keep the data directory on a persistent volume, or it has to be downloaded again after the container is recreated."
